cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Image Preprocessing Detector
abstract: >
  Intelligent image preprocessing detection system for RAG applications.
  Automatically analyzes documents (PDFs, images) and detects required
  preprocessing steps (e.g., skew/blur/contrast/orientation, tables/images/
  handwriting/formulas) before vector-database ingestion.
authors:
